<h1 class="greeting">Password Reset Request 🔐</h1>

<p class="message">
    We received a request to reset your password for your Vorkana account. 
    If you didn't make this request, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>

<div class="alert alert-warning">
    <strong>Security Notice:</strong> For your protection, this link will expire in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>.
</p>
</div>

<div class="btn-center">
    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        {{buttonText}}
    </a>
</div>

<p class="message">
    <strong>Or copy this link to your browser:</strong>
</p>

<div class="code-block">
    {{resetUrl}}
</div>

<div class="alert alert-danger" style="margin-top: 32px;">
    <strong>⚠️ Security Tips:</strong>
    <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0 20px;">
        <li>Never share your password with anyone</li>
        <li>Use a strong, unique password</li>
        <li>Enable two-factor authentication for extra security</li>
        <li>Regularly update your password</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<h3 style="color: #111827; margin: 32px 0 16px 0;">Having trouble?</h3>

<ul class="features-list">
    <li><strong>Link not working?</strong> Try copying and pasting the URL directly into your browser</li>
    <li><strong>Didn't request this?</strong> Your account is safe. No changes will be made</li>
    <li><strong>Need more help?</strong> Contact our security team immediately</li>
</ul>

<p class="message" style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280;">
    This is an automated security email. Please do not reply to this message.<br>
    For security inquiries, email: <a href="mailto:security@vorkana.com" style="color: #10b981;">security@vorkana.com</a>
</p>